{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "uu5ukoygifvg901g", "title": "Redis 6硬盘级加速：多级磁盘一致性新方案！", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"lMys2\" id=\"lMys2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a0403fa\" id=\"u7a0403fa\">步骤概述：</span></h1><ol list=\"u48b9ac1d\"><li fid=\"u1e15b5d6\" data-lake-id=\"u19a1df31\" id=\"u19a1df31\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf48bbef3\" id=\"uf48bbef3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">定义多级服务器结构：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uae1cf684\" id=\"uae1cf684\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">分别在本地服务器和Redis服务器之间设置数据存储，降低主数据库的查询负担。</span></li><li fid=\"u1e15b5d6\" data-lake-id=\"uaf250c25\" id=\"uaf250c25\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u46cf5ae1\" id=\"u46cf5ae1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">更新策略：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4f3f1e22\" id=\"u4f3f1e22\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">当数据发生变更时，优先更新数据库，再更新存储。</span></li><li fid=\"u1e15b5d6\" data-lake-id=\"u99b0fe5a\" id=\"u99b0fe5a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6232721d\" id=\"u6232721d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">失效：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u18b370e4\" id=\"u18b370e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">策略</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1e62f33c\" id=\"u1e62f33c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">采用异步失效通知机制，保证多级服务器的同步。</span></li></ol><h1 data-lake-id=\"kCJCf\" id=\"kCJCf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue29c5614\" id=\"ue29c5614\">核心代码实现</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"SfKWF\" id=\"SfKWF\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0a8be4c\" id=\"ub0a8be4c\">依赖库</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22xml%5Cn%5Cn%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cn%3C!--%20%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0Redis%E7%9A%84Java%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF%E4%BE%9D%E8%B5%96%20--%3E%5Cn%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%3CgroupId%3Eredis.clients%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%3CartifactId%3Ejedis%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%3Cversion%3E3.3.0%3C%2Fversion%3E%5Cn%3C%2Fdependency%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SLEo2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"h4Z1h\" id=\"h4Z1h\" data-lake-index-type=\"0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc9585e0\" id=\"ubc9585e0\">定义了服务器服务类 创建一个</span><code data-lake-id=\"u54b8c458\" id=\"u54b8c458\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3e80053\" id=\"ub3e80053\">CacheService</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0146fd07\" id=\"u0146fd07\">类，其中包含本地服务器和Redis服务器的读写方法。</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Java%20%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cnimport%20redis.clients.jedis.Jedis%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20class%20CacheService%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20final%20ConcurrentHashMap%3CString%2C%20String%3E%20localCache%20%3D%20new%20ConcurrentHashMap%3C%3E()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Redis%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E7%BA%A7%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20final%20Jedis%20redisClient%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20CacheService(String%20redisHost%2C%20int%20redisPort)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20this.redisClient%20%3D%20new%20Jedis(redisHost%2C%20redisPort)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20Stri