ent%20%3D%20new%20Jedis(redisHost%2C%20redisPort)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20void%20subscribeForInvalidation()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20redisClient.subscribe((channel%2C%20message)%20-%3E%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84key%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cacheService.invalidate(message)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%20%5C%22cache_invalidation_channel%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BVR4U%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"b9RAW\" id=\"b9RAW\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufcaf0f25\" id=\"ufcaf0f25\">发布博物馆新闻：</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Java%20%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cnpublic%20void%20publishInvalidation(String%20key)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20redisClient.publish(%5C%22cache_invalidation_channel%5C%22%2C%20key)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Oox5g%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"hUzE7\" id=\"hUzE7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4d73604\" id=\"uf4d73604\">总结</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u236382bf\" id=\"u236382bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub15a5364\" id=\"ub15a5364\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">通过方法，当数据库中数据发生变化时，可以通过Redis的发布/订阅机制触发服务器故障，保证多级服务器（本地服务器与Redis服务器）的一致性。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 608, "description": "步骤概述：定义多级服务器结构：分别在本地服务器和Redis服务器之间设置数据存储，降低主数据库的查询负担。更新策略：当数据发生变更时，优先更新数据库，再更新存储。失效：策略采用异步失效通知机制，保证多级服务器的同步。核心代码实现1. 依赖库xml  复制代码 ", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:17.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:38:59.000Z", "id": 216261290, "status": 1}